# Phase Question Pack

- After each phase gate package is complete, update
  `docs/00-governance/TEAM_QUESTION_PACK.md` and **ask the user** the still-open
  questions grouped by related/owning phase.
- Do not wait idly for answers. Continue only the work authorized by
  `docs/00-governance/CURRENT_PHASE.md`.
- Do not invent answers, close an `OQ-*`, or treat chat discussion as a decision.
  Record a returned answer in `docs/00-governance/registers/OPEN_QUESTIONS.md`
  only when the user supplies it; then refresh the question pack.
- Partial answers are allowed. Apply what arrived; leave the rest open.
- The next phase still requires explicit approval and checkpoint. A question
  pack is not approval and is not an implementation unlock.
